    "label": "21",
    "prompt": "A rectangular billboard displays $48\\text{ m}^2$ of advertising with border of width $x$ metres on all sides.\n\nThe advertising area is twice as long as it is wide. Let the width of the advertising be $w$ metres.\n\nShow that the total area of the billboard is $$A=48+12\\sqrt{6}\\,x+4x^2.$$",
